-- qa/activities-memories-two-scope-cutover-20261120:supabase/schema/0256_qa_personal_experience_history_visibility.sql (original number 0256). Kept verbatim so the
-- repository replays to the live QA schema. QA only; never apply to Production.
-- QA follow-up: read the account-owned revision history already written by
