-- QA ONLY: an overdue account cannot be finalized while paired.
-- Allow only the trusted service to invoke the already-reviewed immutable
-- relationship closure with the due account as actor, then purge shared files.
-- BOTH the account and relationship gates remain OFF in normal QA operation.
